WEBVTT

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:04.260
Universal Century 0096.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.510
Banagher Links,

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:08.840
a student attending
the Anaheim Electronics Industrial College

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.630
at the colony Industrial 7,

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:14.050
has a fateful encounter with
a green-eyed girl falling from the sky.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.680
As THE fighting begins within the colony,

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.380
Banagher returns to Magallanica

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:22.680
to rescue the girl
who calls herself Audrey.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.970
His father Cardeas Vist entrusts him
with the Unicorn Gundam,

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:31.130
the key to Laplace's Box which could
overturn the Federation government.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:36.220
Get the hell out of here!

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:40.090
Banagher fends off the Sleeves mobile suit,

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:42.300
but as the battle ends
he loses consciousness,

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:45.010
and is retrieved by
the Earth Federation Forces warship

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:46.800
the Nahel Argama.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:50.340
Banagher and Audrey
are reunited aboard the ship.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.050
Escape with me.

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:56.010
However, the Nahel Argama is attacked
by the masked Full Frontal,

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.550
who is said to be
the second coming of the Red Comet.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:03.630
Let's see... Let's test the performance
of your new Gundam.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:08.970
Frontal's target is the Unicorn Gundam,
the key to the Box.

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:14.590
Meanwhile the girl called Audrey, who is
actually the Zeon princess Mineva Zabi,

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:16.720
is taken prisoner by the Federation.

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:51.550
I've verified the image.

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:56.110
(CLASH WITH THE RED COMET)

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:55.550
I am Captain Full Frontal of Neo Zeon.

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:56.010
Let's hear your demands.

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:57.010
Let's hear your demands.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.300
That's Char's voice...

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.050
This is Commander Daguza Mackle

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:05.680
of the Earth Federation Space Force
Special Operations Group, ECOAS.

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:09.720
We're requesting you cease all attacks
and withdraw immediately.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:13.880
If you do, we will guarantee
the safety of Mineva Zabi.

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.590
So we can't have her back?

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:23.380
It's negotiable, but only after our ship
has reached a safe location.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.180
Then you're not holding her captive,
you're holding her hostage.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:31.050
And we have no evidence that
you have the real Princess Mineva.

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:36.630
Rather timid, for a man called
the Second Coming of the Red Comet.

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:40.430
From your point of view,
we're merely terrorists.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:41.970
Any group unrecognized as military and

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:46.430
unprotected by international law
needs to be cautious.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:49.130
We have the highest regard
for human rights.

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.510
That's quite a statement

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:53.470
coming from those who send special forces
into civilian colonies.

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:56.800
And now you're using hostages as shields.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:00.510
Now it's our turn to make some demands.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:05.340
I request you hand over the materials
you collected from Industrial 7

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:09.590
and all data pertaining to Laplace's Box.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:12.720
And in exchange?

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.680
We'll guarantee your safe passage.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:16.720
Unless you object to that arrangement.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:18.970
I have no objection,
but we are unable to comply.

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:22.260
We don't have anything
related to Laplace's Box.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:26.760
Didn't you recover
a Gundam type mobile suit?

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.680
That's the property
of the Federation Forces.

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:30.550
It has nothing to do with the Box.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:33.840
If you can't accept our demands,
we'll be forced to destroy your vessel.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:37.130
You would ignore the life of our captive?

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:40.760
We can't conduct negotiations
based on an uncertain factor.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.430
I'll give you three minutes.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.470
I hope you'll have come to
a wise decision.

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:58.050
He's bluffing. He wouldn't forsake
the guiding star of the Zeon remnants.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.590
I don't know about that...

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:06.340
If Full Frontal is really Char Aznable

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.050
he'd be the son of Zeon Deikun.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:10.340
There's no reason
an enemy of the Zabi family

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:12.010
would care about their descendants.

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:16.680
The way you say that makes me believe
you're the real Mineva Zabi.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:28.550
And I'm certain a good number
of those Sleeves soldiers

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:29.760
believe in the Zabi family.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:33.550
If you truly believe that,
then continue these useless negotiations.

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:37.720
But the soldiers of Zeon
don't play as nicely as you do.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:39.340
If you were a Zeon soldier,

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:44.260
you'd be figuring out how to dispose of
anything related to Laplace's Box.

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:45.470
She's right!

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:48.220
We should destroy
the Unicorn's electronic systems

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:49.680
while we have the chance.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.010
That thing is the "key", right?

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.630
It's not the actual "Box",

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:55.340
so if we destroy it,
the safety of the Box will- -

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:05.380
Show me the pride of a Federation soldier,
Commander Daguza Mackle.

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:09.720
If you have the nerve,
then destroy the key and kill me as well.

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:15.630
Losing the key and me
will undoubtedly deal a blow to Neo Zeon.

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:20.470
Otherwise, you can keep doing nothing
and let them take everything from you.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:22.090
There is no time to delay.

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:26.930
Audrey!

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:30.050
You can't talk like that.

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:32.510
You're backing everyone into a corner,
including yourself.

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:33.970
Banagher...

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:35.300
Let's get out of here.

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:37.510
This isn't something for you
to be involved in!

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:41.680
I am Mineva Zabi.

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:42.970
You're Audrey!

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:46.010
Whether it's your real name or not,
to me you're still Audrey Burne!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.220
Enough!

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.550
This is no time for children to be arguing.

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:52.720
"Children"? What about Audrey?

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:55.380
She is a Neo Zeon dignitary.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:58.220
But if I'm just a kid, Audrey is too!

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:01.470
And now you're holding this kid hostage!
Is that how adults behave?!

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:06.470
Time's up. Let's hear your answer.

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:16.590
Understood. Now we'll destroy your vessel.

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:18.090
Here it comes!

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:22.220
Anti-air defenses, ready!
Mobile suit corps, prepare to intercept!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.680
It's just a box.

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:27.340
Why don't you hand it over to them?!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.680
We don't even know what it is.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.630
Why do so many people have to die for it?

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.930
So would you take the responsibility?

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:39.180
They say whatever is
hidden in Laplace's Box

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.550
could overthrow the Federation.

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:47.550
If you give that to Neo Zeon,
and even more lives are lost...

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:51.180
Then how do you intend to apologize
to the dead and their families.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:54.680
Continue.

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:59.970
Cease fire immediately!
Otherwise we will execute Mineva Zabi.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:02.470
This is not an empty threat.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:04.720
Cease your attacks at once!

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:10.930
If we take down that red mobile suit, then
you won't need Audrey as a hostage, right?

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.260
I'll do it!

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:28.050
Stand down! Withdraw!!

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:29.090
Riddhe!

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.470
If it weren't for you we wouldn't be

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:39.300
trying to play hostage games
with a bunch of terrorists!

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.300
Ensign Riddhe, get a grip!

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:01.930
Commander!

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:08.430
Commander Norm...

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.010
You bastard!

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:21.470
What the...?!

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:27.930
Gundam...

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.380
The Gundam is on catapult one!

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.630
What are you doing? Stop it!

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:35.630
Gundam pilot, identify yourself!

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.050
You are not cleared for launch.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.720
Return to the ship immediately!

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.050
You...

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:43.300
This is a compromise
that works for everyone.

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.930
The Unicorn's performance is rock-solid.

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:50.260
Even a novice pilot with no training
can buy us enough time to get out of here.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.340
You're practically giving away the Box.

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:53.930
But that's only the key.

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:56.470
If the key is broken,
the Box will never open

00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:58.800
and the Federation's interests
will be protected.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:05.930
He'll fight for us and won't quit
until the Unicorn is destroyed.

00:10:08.010 --> 00:10:09.880
You can hear me, can't you, Banagher?

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:13.720
You already know
how to initiate the system, don't you?

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.760
Banagher, don't do this!

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.430
That pilot suit has a system

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:27.180
that pharmacologically reduces
the strain on the body from G resistance.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:31.010
Once the NT-D is activated,
it'll work automatically.

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:32.180
NT-D?

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:35.630
That's the mode in which
the Unicorn's limiter is disengaged.

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:39.090
You've handled it once before.
You'll be fine.

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:41.840
Preparations for launch complete!

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:47.760
Detaching!

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:06.220
Found it!

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:16.220
Amazing...

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:27.090
It barely grazed him, but...

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:33.630
Captain!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:43.630
I can't believe I fired. I've ruined
the Captain's perfect battlefield!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.470
You made me shoot!

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.470
Gotta keep calm.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:32.880
It doesn't matter how powerful
they are if they can't hit me!

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:46.180
You moved for me?

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:52.130
An I-Field?!

00:13:16.180 --> 00:13:17.470
I did it?

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:31.380
Audrey...

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.300
I can see now...

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:32.380
So this is Gundam.

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:42.800
You're my opponent again, Gundam?

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:44.220
Withdraw now!

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:46.550
If you don't withdraw, then Audrey will...

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:51.300
We'll flank it! Climb!

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.550
Get back!

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:13.840
Don't charge in too close!

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:22.260
Behind you!

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:24.470
The Quad-wing?!

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:37.590
I'm sorry,

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:39.470
Audrey...

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:51.840
Why is that boy inside a Gundam?

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:54.340
Much appreciated, Lieutenant Marida Cruz.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:00.840
I'm sorry, Audrey.

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:42.800
As a child, I remember seeing
a Zabi family speech on TV...

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:46.380
Sieg Zeon, Sieg Zeon...

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:49.720
It was a terrifying image.

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:56.430
Thousands of people were shouting in unison
incited by Gihren Zabi, your uncle.

00:16:57.720 --> 00:16:59.880
I guess you, Neo Zeon, still do now.

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:01.970
"Sieg Zeon..."

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:03.590
Go ahead and say it for me now.

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:04.930
Say it!

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:13.050
Convince me that
you're really a Princess of Zeon.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:14.630
Otherwise...

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:17.050
Why did someone like Mineva Zabi

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:20.220
slip aboard a Federation ship
all by herself?

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:23.720
The professionals
will find that out from you.

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:30.340
One thing you should remember, though...

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:34.300
He was calling your name
until the very end.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:39.090
Not "Mineva Zabi",
he kept calling you "Audrey".

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:44.130
You don't understand anything.

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:48.800
Who are these "professionals"
you mentioned?

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:51.180
We have official investigators.

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:55.430
They'll never bring this matter
to any judicial authorities.

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:59.260
Nor will my presence here
be made known to the public.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:05.260
Full Frontal stubbornly refused to accept
that I am actually Mineva Zabi.

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:06.430
Why do you think that is?

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:11.800
That was
just to negate our hostage tactics.

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:14.010
Think about it and you'll see.

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:17.720
How have I managed to keep from
being captured for almost ten years?

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:20.630
And how has Neo Zeon once again been able
to have bases in the Earth Sphere

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:22.590
and build up its armaments?

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:25.510
You're saying there were backdoor dealings?

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:29.760
The incident at Industrial 7
will disappear from your news reports.

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:32.380
It won't be easy
for the families and friends

00:18:32.430 --> 00:18:34.340
of those who died to forgive it.

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:37.970
But Spacenoids have long been accustomed
to these kinds of outrages.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:41.220
And the Federation has allowed us to exist

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:44.300
as a scapegoat
for their anger and frustration.

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:46.130
At least, until now...

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:50.470
Laplace's Box has upset the balance?

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:52.840
The Federation might be taking steps to

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:55.510
resolve its relationship with Neo Zeon
once and for all.

00:18:57.010 --> 00:19:01.680
That's why the Vist Foundation
offered up its precious box.

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:04.720
Sounds complicated.

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:09.510
I've always thought of myself as a pilot.

00:19:10.220 --> 00:19:15.760
My job is simply to operate a mobile suit,
complete the missions I'm assigned

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:18.300
and I don't need to
think about anything else.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.010
Even if there's corruption once in a while

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:24.050
I believed that the Federation
had the ability to correct itself.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.260
Except, that's not true.

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:30.010
I was just trying not to see it.
Not think about it,

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:31.840
ever since I was with my family.

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:35.840
Why have you acted alone?

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:40.970
I too was born into a certain family.

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:44.340
The family that shouldered
the blame for the One Year War.

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:48.970
I cannot consider myself
separate from politics.

00:19:49.010 --> 00:19:52.300
And if the same mistakes
are about to be repeated

00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:54.470
I am obligated to prevent it,
at the cost of my life.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:56.340
It is my responsibility.

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:59.010
Hey, Riddhe.
There's activity around the ship.

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.840
The supply corps is here, I'll bet.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.430
No one will come here.

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.260
I also stopped the cameras.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.590
I know.

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:09.840
You are a person of Zeon.

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:13.260
Even if you've been secretly collaborating,
you're an enemy here.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:15.510
You guys killed Commander Norm
and the others.

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:18.130
I simply can't forgive that.

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:20.470
I understand.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.090
You said your name is
Riddhe Marcenas, correct?

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:28.430
Yeah.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:30.430
Meaning the family you were born into...

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:33.720
I wish we could've met
under different circumstances.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:44.010
What I can do...

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:19.680
I hear this is a replica of a room

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:22.470
in the last fortress
of the former Principality, A Baoa Qu.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:25.380
The Governor General of Palau

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:28.300
is an ardent sympathizer
of the former Principality of Zeon.

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:31.300
I must accept a favor like this graciously.

00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:33.300
Even if the decor isn't really my style.

00:21:33.840 --> 00:21:38.010
I suppose that's one
necessary trait of a leader.

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:43.090
Good job Captain, Lieutenant Marida.
I'll take it from here.

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:45.470
Captain...

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:46.880
I know.

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:50.800
Princess Mineva being held
aboard that ship was unexpected.

00:21:52.220 --> 00:21:56.300
But there will be other chances
to rescue her, including political methods.

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:57.510
We have to deal with it for now.

00:21:57.550 --> 00:21:58.630
Yes.

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:05.970
Char Aznable...

00:23:38.260 --> 00:23:41.720
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.760 --> 00:23:44.010
UNDER THE MASK,

00:23:45.010 --> 00:23:48.260
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
